        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202ce-582d-74d2-9cc2-794973d1122d -->\n**Serious** \u00b7 Concurrent startups can abort during the version-2 upgrade\n\nTwo console invocations can both read `user_version = 1` before either migrates. After one commits, the other still attempts to create `deliveries_due_by_queue`.\n\nSQLite raises an index-already-exists error before the second command runs.\n\nAcquire the write transaction with `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` before reading `user_version`, and apply pending migrations within that transaction.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Details</summary>\n\nThe specific failure on a version-1 database comes from the newly added migration. Before this change, version-1 databases skipped all migration DDL, although the same stale-version pattern could race during initial database creation.\n\n</details>\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cc-8750-73ce-b8ef-f0fb093c13ba/findings/01a202ce-5833-7461-83b8-e3ff04e0285d)",
