        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202ce-5831-770f-adb4-135c65122756 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 First history request after upgrade scans the entire delivery table\n\nThis change builds the partial index before dispatching `history`, scanning every delivery even if none are pending.\n\nOn a version-1 database, `history --limit 1` waits for an extra O(N) scan of N deliveries before fetching at most two rows, unlike before this change.\n\nBuild the index in an explicit upgrade step before serving history requests.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cc-8750-73ce-b8ef-f0fb093c13ba/findings/01a202ce-5839-721f-8339-4d11eccfbd40)",
